<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Tvůj voucher na servis</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f6f8f7;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f6f8f7;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:100%;">
        <!-- Hlavička: plocha hlubina, bílá značka + slovo kapka -->
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color:#0a2e33;padding:24px 32px;border-radius:2px 20px 0 0;">
            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td style="padding-right:12px;vertical-align:middle;">
                  <img src="https://orgfarm-90b25041ad-dev-ed.develop.my.site.com/kapkaportal/sfsites/c/resource/kapkaMarkWhitePng" width="40" height="40" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;">
                </td>
                <td style="vertical-align:middle;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#ffffff;">
                  kapka
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <!-- Karta s kódem -->
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:32px;border:1px solid #d5e0df;border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 20px 20px;font-family:'Instrument Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#0f2226;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;color:#0f2226;">
              Hotovo. Tady je tvůj voucher.
            </p>
            <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#4d6366;">
              {!Voucher__c.Reward_Name__c} · Partner: EneServis
            </p>
            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px;">
              <tr>
                <td style="background-color:#ddf0ee;padding:16px 24px;border-radius:2px 8px 8px 8px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#0f2226;">
                  {!Voucher__c.Code__c}
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;">
              V EneServisu kód stačí nadiktovat.
            </p>
            <p style="margin:0;color:#4d6366;">
              Voucher neexpiruje. Najdeš ho i v portálu Kapka Klubu.
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:16px 32px;font-family:'Instrument Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#4d6366;">
            Kapka Klub · Kapka a.s.
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
